<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Philippite</book>
  <para style="h">Philippite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philippite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philippite</para>
  <para style="mt">Philippite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Christ Jesus ii naseamte ahi Paul le Timothy in — Christ Jesus taw pumkhat a om pawlpi lampuite le, Husyate a kihel Philippi ah a om Pathian ii mite theampo tungah lai kong thaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noma kong ngaisut simin, noma hu in ka Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciangin no teng theampo atu thu ka nget simin thinnop lungdamna taw thu ka ngen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ka kipat phit ni pan tu dong lungdamna thu nasepna sungah nong hu zia uhte ka ngaisut hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom no sungah hi nasep pha hong patpui Pathian in nasep a kizaw tu hun Christ Jesus Ni ciang dong na hong seam suak tu ka ci ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thinsung ah no kong phawk tawntung hi! Tuabangin kong phaw sia kei atu in a kilawm thu ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile, tu laitak thonginn sungah ka om laitak ahizong, lungdamna thu ii a maanna sia huuk tu le kipsak tu in ka suatak laitak ahizong, Pathian ii hong piak hi phattuamna nong saan pui tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thukin no kong phawna sia Christ Jesus mama ii thinsung pan hong luang tatak ahi hunlam ka tetti sia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ki itna na khantosak seseam natu, heakna maan le thukhenna maan na nei khop thei natu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua tungtawnin, a phabel sia na teal thei natu in thu kong ngetsak hi. Tuasia ciangin Christ ii Ni hong thet hunin niinnoina teng le mawsiatna theampo taw na kipeal tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian minthan natu le ama pok natu in Jesus Christ bek ii piansak thei a maan pilna thiamnate taw na nuntakna uh hong kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suapuite awng, kei tungah hong tung thute sia lungdamna thu khangtosak takpi ahi hunlam na tel tu uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua thute taw kizomin, kumpi inncing ngalkap bup le hi sungah a om a dang teng in kei sia Christ ii naseam ka hi hu a thongtaak ka hi hunlam he siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thong sungah ka om hu in u le nau a tamzaw in Topa tungah thinmuanna neizaw uh a, tuaciang ngupna thu lau ngawlin hil ngam vaial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate sung panin pawlkhatte ahile eenna le kingal vawtna thin taw Christ thuhil a, ahizong a dangte in thupha deina takpi taw hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian ii kei sia lungdamna thu a maanna dinpui tu nasep hong piak hunlam amate in he ahikom hite in ki itna taw ma thu a hil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dangte ahile Christ thu sia thinpha taw thangsak ngawl a, amate kaang sung vai tupna thin taw hil uh hi; thonginn sungah ka om laitakin hong nawngkaisak thei zaw tu in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Phamaw ka sa bua hi! Hisia huvau ka lungdam hi — tupna maan taw ahizong, ahi bua zong Christ thu a nanamin kihil hi pole ka lungdam veve hi. Tuaciangin ka lungdamna sia kizom suak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />banghang ziam cile nong thungetsakna uh le Jesus Christ ii Thaa kung pan hong pai huna taw kei hong kisuaktasak tu ci sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka deina tatak le ka lametna sia bang ziam cile ka thi zong ka nung zong ka nuntakna buppi taw Christ vaang ka piak thei natu, hun theampo sung, a tuanin tu hun sung teng seseamin, hangsan takin ka panmun ka lel ngeingawl natu thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nuntakna sia bang ziam? Kei atu in, nuntakna sia Christ hi a, thina sia hamphat zawk natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahizong ka nuntak ciangin a thupi nasepte seam thei zaw tu ka hile, thina le nuntakna, ka teal sawn tu ka he vaset bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei sia ka lang le ka lang panin hong kikang hi. Hi nuntakna nusia in Christ taw ka omkhawm nuam mama a, tua in a phazaw kan thu ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ahihang no atu in ci leang a nungta in om lai leng thupi zawlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hi thu thiangtel ka hikomin a nungta a om tu ka hina ka he hi, upna sungah noma khantona le thinnopna a kibelap natu in no teng taw kong om lai tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua hile no kungah kong haw kik ciangin Christ Jesus taw kipumkhat in na nuntakna sungah kei nong kiphatsak pui seseam thei natu a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu in a thupi thu in na nuntakna uh sia Christ lungdamna thu ii dei bang tatak ahi natu thu ahi hi, tua hile kei kong pai thei a, kong pai maw zong note tupna kibang khat tungah kip takin a dingte hi a, deina khat bek taw lungdamna thu upna atu ngaldo khawmte na hi hunlam kong za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ngalte na kiita heak vun; na thinlian tawntung tavun, tua hile amate in hong lel tu a, noma in na zo tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile zawna hong pia sia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama um bek ngawlin, ama hang a ngimna na thuakna uh taw, Christ atu nasep thei natu in hamphatna nga na hi uh hang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu in keima taw kopin ngaldona sungah na kihel thei tu uh hi. Tua ngalkidona sia nidang zongin ka do nong mu uh a, tu zongh in na zaak uh bangma in ka do lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Christ sungah na nuntakna in, hong thahatsak a, tuaciang ama hong itna in hong thinnuamsak hi. Note in Thaa taw na kipawlkhawm uh a, tuaciang khat le khat ii tungah dikna le ciliapna na nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka lungdamna nong pawlcinsak natu in ngaisutna kibangin, ki itna khat nei khawm a, thin khat lung khat hi in na om natu uh kong hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaangsung atu tupna bek taw ahizong, kisak thei nopna lel taw ahizong bangma seam heak vun, tua hi ngawlzaw in, khat le khat ii tungah kiniamkhiakin noma sangin ngualdangte a phazaw in ngaisun tawntung zaw vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noma ii kinsante bek na en heak vun a, khat le khat ii kinsante zongh na ki etpui tavun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Christ Jesus ii a nei thinpuak na nei tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Pathian ii pianzia nei nginge a, ahihang Pathian taw kikim natu in zawthawk thu zanghin hanciam tu a ngaisun bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hi ngawlzaw in, ama uuk thu in a nei theampo nusia in naseampa pianzia la hi. Ama in mihing taw kibangin piang a, mihing bangin kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in kiniamkhiak a, a thi tu in thunitna lampi tawn a — a thina thinglamtee tung dongah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi thu hangin Pathian in ama sia a saangbelna munah laamto a mindang khat pawpo sangin a lianzaw min pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus min patoai natu in vantung, leitung ah nuntakna a nei theampo, nuai simlei ah a om theampo in khupdin tu uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang a theampo in Pa Pathian minthan natu Jesus Christ sia Topa hi ci in, a kilangh takin thangsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka itte awng, no kungah kong om lai in ka thu nong nit tawntung uh bangma in, no taw kong omkhop ngawl ciang ngawngawn in, ka thu nong nit tu uh sia thupi zaw lai hi. Na ngupna a cingtaak natu in launa le liinna taw na seam tan tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama deina na zui thei natu le na uuk natu in Pathian sia a tawntung na sung uh ah na hong seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na theampo ah phun ngawl, nial ngawlin seam vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua hile mawna le ngamtat siatna taw kidim leitung mite kawmah, a sitbaang ngawl Pathian ii tate bangin a maw ngawl, a thiangthote na suak thei tu uh hi. Aksite ii van ah a taan bangma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nuntakna thu amate na son uh ciangin amate sungah na taang tu uh hi. Tuabangin na hi uh le Christ Ni hong thet ciangin, no kong kiphatsak pui natu a thu ka nei tu hi, banghang ziam cile ka hanciamna sa le ka sepna sa teng a luithawthong hi ngawl hi ci in hong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Note upna hangin Pathian a kipia sangaw biakpiakna tungah piakkhiatna khat bangin ka nuntakna chisan kibua tu ahile zong ka lungdam tu a, ka thinnopna no theampo kong hawmsawn tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in note zongh na lung uh na damsak vun a, na thinnopna uh kei nong hawm tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa ii deina a om le noma thu ka zaakna taw ka kihansua natu in Timothy kong paisak pal thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama bekma sia kei taw ngaisutna kisi a, no hong thinnuammaw tatak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midang khat pawpo ahile Jesus Christ atu sangin, ama ii aituam thute bek kin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama taktai ziate bangbangin hong lak a, ama le kei sia pata bangin lungdamna thu atu bangza in diangkhawm khu ziam ci sia na heak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka vai bangbang takin hong piang tu ci in ka heak po ciang, no kungah ama kong paisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima mama no kung kong pai pal thei natu in Topa ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima hong hu tu in kamtai a na zak sa uh, kei taw kop a, naseamin ngal hong do pui ih suapui Epaphroditus kong paisak kul tu hi ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in note theampo hong mu tu kaal ngakla a, a cina hi ci in na zaak uh sia a thinnuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama a cina takpi peu a, thi dektak zawsap hi. Ahihang Pathian in ama hesuak a, ama bek hi ngawlin kei zongh, khuangaina nasia zaw ka thuak ngawl natu in hong hesuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom kong paisak tu sia ka thalawp kan hi. Tua hile ama na mu uh ciang na lungdam tu a, kei khuangaina bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa sungah suapui khat a hina hangin lungdamna taw na saang vun. Ama bang ahi tua mi theampo tungah zatakna lak tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />banghang ziam cile kei nong hu thei ngawlna munah huna hong piak natu in, Christ ii na a sepna sungah a luangkhaamin a thi dektak pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thukhupna ah, ka suapuite awng, Topa taw pumkhat na hina uh taw kisai in lungpil tavun. Ka at sa thute ka at kikik sia phamaw sa tuan ngawl khi hi, note thinmuan natu hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sia a vawtte, tua uite, vunteap at kul hi a ci hamtangte, na encik tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A maan vunteap atna a neite sia amate hi ngawl a, eima ih hi zaw hi, banghang ziam cile eite in Pathian sia ama Thaa taw ih bia a, Christ Jesus taw pumkhat a ih nuntakna sung ah, a lawpte ih hi hi. A puatham cii le sa limte tungtaang ah eite in muanna ih nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima zongh tuabang thute muan thei natu a neipa ka hi hi. A puatham cii le sa limte muan thei tu thu nei ing a ci khat po a om le tuabang ci thei natu thu a tamzaw ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka sua zawk nipi khat a cin ciangin ka vunteap hong ki atsak hi. Ka pianna sia Israel mi in ka piang a, Benjamin suan hi in, Hebrew chi tatak ka hi hi. Jew te Thukham zuina taw kizomin keima in Pharisee khat ka hi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a biakna sangah tha lawp leilam ka hi komin, pawlpi ka vawtsia zazaan hi. Mihing khat in thukham tanna taw thutang suak thei tu hile sitbaanna ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang meetna in ka ngaisut thei thute theampo sia tu in Christ atu hangin supna hizaw hi ci in ka tuat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate bek ahi bua hi: ka Topa Christ Jesus heakna thu sia manpha zaw pek ahi hu in nadang theampo sia supna hi ci in ka tuat hi. Ama hangin na theampo ka vawk zo hi; Christ ka nei thei natu le, ama taw pumkhat ka sua bit thei natu in na theampo sia ninbu lomtangh bang bekin ka ngaisun hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thukham zuina taw a kinga theite nam ahi keima aituam thutang suana khat sia ka nei nawn bua hi. Christ ih upna tungtawnin hong kipia, Pathian kung pan hong pai upna a kibulphu thutang sia tu in ka nei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Christ heak tu le ama thaw kikna vaangletna siim tu, ama thuaknate thuakpui tu, a thina sungah ama taw kiban tu sia ka dei bulpi ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua in keima mama thina pan nuntakna ah ka thaw kik tu ka lametna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nasepna taangtun zo ing, tua ahibuale cialcing zo ing ci ngawl khi hi. Jesus Christ in ama atu in kei hong sungsuam zo a hina tel sia ka nga zawk natu in ka hanciam tan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi hi, ka suapuite awng, tua tel nga zo khi hi, ci in ka ngaisun bua hi; ahizong ka sepna khat sia, nungsang thute mangil in maisang thute ka phak natu in ahi theiza ka hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus Christ tungtawnin tungsang nuntak natu Pathian hong sapna ahi, tel a nga zo tu in tang takin mungtupna sangah ka tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thaa lamsang ah a khanthin eite theampo in hi bang thin ih nei natu ahi hi. Ahihang no pawlkhat in thutuam na nei uh le Pathian in hong telsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabang ahi hial zong, tu dong ciang ih zui sa hi ngeinate taw ma mainawt tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Suapuite awng, keima ngamtat bangin hong zui tawntung tavun. Noma ettee tu a ngamtatna maan kong koisak sia a zuite na nadon`` tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi thute tamvei ma kong son ngei zo a, tu in thitui taw kong son kik hi: a nuntakna zia uh taw thinglamtee tungah Christ' thina ii ngalte a suak mihing tam mama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate sia a khakbel ciangin hell theng tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile cii le sa deinate sia amate ii pathian ahi hi. A maizum huai, a thasiathuaite thangphatna in la uh a, leitung neisa nate bekma ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite ih hile vantung ngammite ih hi a, vantung panin ih Hunpa Topa Jesus Christ hong pai tu thalawp takin ih ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in a thazawm a thithei ih pumpite sia na theampo ama uk sung a thet natu, a vawt theina vaang zangh a, ama ii vaang nei pumpi taw kibangin hong vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom suapuite awng, no sia kei atu bangza in na ithuai uh a, bangza in hong phawk khi ziam! Nong lungdamsak mama uh a, note hu in ka angtang mama hi! — ka it suapuite awng, hisia in na nuntak sung teng Topa sungah na khodin tu uh zia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Euodia le Syntyche te awng, kong nget nop thu in kei nong hesuakna in Topa sungah unau numeite bangin na thukim thei natu uh na hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang a thumaan ka naseppui noma zongh in, hi numeite na hu tu uh ka dei hi; banghang ziam cile amate sia Pathian ii nuntakna laibu sungah a om Clement le ka naseppui dangte theampo taw kop in, lungdamna thu kizel natu in keima taw nasia tak a diangte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa taw pumkhat na hi hu in, a tawntung lungdam tavun. Kong ci kik hi: na lungdam tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing khat sim tungah na cikna uh lak tavun. Topa hong pai pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na khat pawpo atu in thinngim heak vun, ahihang na thungetna theampo ah na kisap uh te, Pathian tungah lungdamko nopna thin taw na ngen tawntung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hile mihing tel zawk ngawl Pathian ii thinnopna in Christ Jesus taw na kipumkhatna hangin, na thin na lung hong ngammuangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khakbel kong cinopna ah ka suapuite awng, thupha le a pok huai thute: a thumaan, mipi tan huai, a thutang, a thiangtho, a ithuaite le a thasiahuai nate na ngaisun tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka kammalte le ka ngamtatnate pan na heak uh, na saan uhte sia na zangh vateak tavun. Tua hile eite thinnopna hong pia Pathian in no taw hong omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa taw kipumkhat a ka nuntak sungah a khuangei hun khat zawkciangin khatvei ma nong thin nopmawkna uh nong lak thei lai natu in, hunpha nga kik na hi uh ciangin ka lungdamna lian hi. Hong kin ngawl nu hi kong ci bua hi — nong thin nopmawkna uh nong lak tu hun om ngawl hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi bang ka ci ciang hong kingaingon kong sakna hi tuan ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile ka nei babang taw lungkim natu ka sin sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cimawkna le ci thei zawknate ka he hi. A koima pawpo ah bang hun po ahizong ngilvana le ngilkialna, hauna le zawnna sungah, lungkim thei natu in hi thuku ka sin sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Christ ii hong piak vaangletna taw na theampo phul zawk natu thahatna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahitazong, ka ngim nganate ah nong hu uh sia na phat mamana uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha ka hil kipat sawng, Macedonia ka nusiat ciangin kei hong hu pawlpi sia noma bekma na hi hunlam noma Philippi te in pha tak ma na heak uh ahi hi; ka nganate le ka supnate ah noma bekma in nong sikpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thessalonica khua ah huna ka kisap laitakin khatvei bek hi ngawlin, huna nong thathaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Letsong nga tute a thangai ka hi bua hi; na thupha vawt sate tungah a meet a kibelap tu ka mu nopna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi sungah nong piaksa uh theampo kong saanna lai om a — kicing vaal hi! Epaphroditus in na letsong uh theampo hong puak ahikom, tu in ka kitaangsap theampo nei zo khi hi. Tuate in Pathian mai ah ngimnamtui piak taw kibangin a saannophuai le dik a sak biakpiakna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang ka Pathian in Jesus Christ tungtawnin a kicing ama hauna theampo taw kizui in na kitaangsap theampo hong sik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ih Pathian le Pa tungah minthanna a tawntung, a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesus Christ ii neisa ahi Pathian mihing khat sim tungah kong paupui hi. Hi sungah keima taw a om u le naute in nuksetna kam hong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi sungah a om Pathian mite theampo, a tuanin Kumpilianpa inn sungah a omte in hong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna note theampo taw om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
